  Host=attacker.local   -> HTTP/1.0 200 OK
  Host=(空)              -> HTTP/1.0 200 OK

  -- 参数非法时的错误处理（预期 500/断连，不应泄露 traceback）--
  /api/posts?limit=abc               -> RemoteDisconnected: Remote end closed connection without response
  /api/consensus?min_holders=x       -> RemoteDisconnected: Remote end closed connection without response
  /api/detail?id=xyz                 -> RemoteDisconnected: Remote end closed connection without response

